; Handwritten fixture: constant invisible pin ATTDEF in a block, a standalone
; ATTDEF with all four flags, two owned ATTRIBs and SEQEND handle FFFE.
; ATTRIB coordinates are already drawing coordinates, not block-local.
; A uses Liberation Sans 2.1.5: advance=1366, cap=1409, ascent=1854,
; descent=-434 font units (independent font metrics, also used by RT17).
D = DXF file=dati.dxf
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
; cambia con #697
? count D -> ATTDEF 1; ATTRIB 2; INSERT 1
? unhandled D -> none
? entity D 101 -> INSERT block="ATTRIBUTES" insertion=20,30 scale=1,1 rotation=0
; cambia con #951
? entity D 100 -> ATTDEF position=10,20 alignment-point=0,0 height=1 rotation=0 width-factor=1 oblique=0 style="Standard" mirror-x=no mirror-y=no horizontal=left vertical=baseline value="LONG_DEFAULT" tag="A" prompt="Reference" invisible=yes constant=yes verify=yes preset=yes lock-position=yes ~box=10,19.69198012775018;10.9694819020582,19.69198012775018;10.9694819020582,21.31582682753726;10,21.31582682753726
? entity D 102 -> ATTRIB owner=257 position=20,30 alignment-point=0,0 height=1 rotation=0 width-factor=1 oblique=0 style="Standard" mirror-x=no mirror-y=no horizontal=left vertical=baseline value="A" tag="A" lock-position=yes color=1 ltscale=2 lineweight=0.50 ~box=20,29.69198012775018;20.9694819020582,29.69198012775018;20.9694819020582,31.31582682753726;20,31.31582682753726
? entity D 103 -> ATTRIB owner=257 position=20,35 alignment-point=0,0 height=1 rotation=0 width-factor=1 oblique=0 style="Standard" mirror-x=no mirror-y=no horizontal=left vertical=baseline value="A" tag="A" invisible=yes lock-position=yes ~box=20,34.69198012775018;20.9694819020582,34.69198012775018;20.9694819020582,36.31582682753726;20,36.31582682753726
? entity D FFFE -> none
